  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to Gazeta Wyborcza Foundation for support to Ukrainian independent regional and local media institutions to enable them to cope with the extreme challenges that the Russian full-scale invasion has brought on Ukraine.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektst&#xf6;d till Gazeta Wyborcza Foundation f&#xf6;r st&#xf6;d till ukrainska oberoende regionala och lokala medieinstitutioner f&#xf6;r att g&#xf6;ra det m&#xf6;jligt f&#xf6;r dem att klara av de extrema utmaningar som den ryska fullskaliga invasionen har medf&#xf6;rt Ukraina.</narrative>
  </description>
